msgctxt "152"
msgid ""
"She's wearing a straw hat and blue clothes! If anything happened to her... "
"No, I can't think about it! Please, find her!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid ""
"Oh, pardon me... Have you seen my daughter? I can't find her anywhere! "
"Please, she's wearing blue!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid "Calm down. Tell me what happened."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "212"
msgid ""
"I'm sorry... It's my daughter. I think she's lost. And I just told her to "
"stay close to me, too!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "224"
msgid "I'm from Tokyo⑬I'm only here on vacation! I don't know this place at all!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid "Please! Could you help me look for my daughter?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid "She can't be that hard to find! My Sakura is cute enough to be on TV!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "260"
msgid "(A lost child, huh? Seems pretty urgent.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
msgid "Don't worry. I'm sure she'll be back soon enough."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid "What are you talking about?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid ""
"I mean... what if she's been... been... kidnapped!? Oh, I can't take this! "
"What do I do!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "308"
msgid "Sakura! Where are you? Come here! Come to Mommy, darling!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid "Sure, I'll help. What does your daughter look like?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "344"
msgid "Thank you... She's wearing her favorite straw hat."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "356"
msgid ""
"I told her not to leave the arcade here, so she's probably in here "
"somewhere..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "368"
msgid "All right. If I see her, I'll be sure to call you over."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "380"
msgid ""
"I don't want you to miss her if she does come this way, so you stay put, "
"okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "404"
msgid "All right, I'm in."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "416"
msgid "She'll be back soon."
msgstr ""

